# Control-plane roots: a change here is a change to how this repo decides, not what it ships.
# fabrika's `ship cp-approval` routes on this file; with no owner declared it holds every PR
# that touches a governed root as `unknown` rather than waving it through.
#
# Every `.fabrika.jsonc` `governedRoots` entry has its own row below, and
# `scripts/check-codeowners.mjs` fails CI when one is missing. CODEOWNERS follows governedRoots,
# never the other way around: add the root there first, then its row here.
/.claude/                           @kamp-us/control-plane
/.github/                           @kamp-us/control-plane
/.fabrika.jsonc                     @kamp-us/control-plane
/biome.jsonc                        @kamp-us/control-plane
/packages/code-graph/biome.jsonc    @kamp-us/control-plane

# Compatibility entries required by the pinned Fabrika guard; remove after the upstream fix:
# https://github.com/kamp-us/phoenix/issues/10542
/.claude-plugin/                   @kamp-us/control-plane
/packages/ci-required/             @kamp-us/control-plane
/packages/fabrika-cli/src/ci/       @kamp-us/control-plane
/biome-plugins/                    @kamp-us/control-plane
**/lefthook*                       @kamp-us/control-plane
**/.lefthook*                      @kamp-us/control-plane

# `fabrika campaign` takes campaign authority from the control-plane team above (fabrika >= 0.8
# retired `.fabrika.jsonc` `campaignAuthors`, phoenix#9852).
